{"id":"n89071-1-8","stage":3,"title":"효도 · 孝","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89071-1-8-1","ko":"부모님 제가 해외여행 시켜 드릴게요.","zh":"爸妈，我安排你们去国外旅行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부모님","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"해외여행","meaning":"海外旅行，境外游","explanation":"해외여행：海外旅行，境外游","readings":[{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72474","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}},{"text":"시켜","meaning":"让，叫","explanation":"시키다：让，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"1","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시켜","audio":"/audio/e07de763467027c6d0f5.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"ac0e9e